1
00:00:00,486 --> 00:00:01,673
Narration: Teach one phone task.

2
00:00:02,221 --> 00:00:04,241
Narration: Reuse it with new words and values.

3
00:00:09,246 --> 00:00:13,117
Request: Teach. Order a Margherita pizza, from Brik Oven, on Zomato.

4
00:00:16,245 --> 00:00:19,375
EchoFlow: Okay, show me in Zomato. Tap Done when you're finished. I never pay.

5
00:00:23,502 --> 00:00:24,542
Request: Record my taps.

6
00:00:25,971 --> 00:00:29,701
EchoFlow: Okay, I'll record your taps myself from now on. If I missed one, go back and tap it again.

7
00:00:30,926 --> 00:00:32,638
Narration: The lesson starts inside Zomato.

8
00:00:33,177 --> 00:00:34,853
Narration: We demonstrate the restaurant search,

9
00:00:34,997 --> 00:00:36,374
Narration: pizza selection, and cart.

10
00:00:37,372 --> 00:00:40,325
Narration: EchoFlow turns those screen actions into a reusable task,

11
00:00:40,479 --> 00:00:42,907
Narration: without a custom integration for this ordering app.

12
00:00:59,936 --> 00:01:03,086
EchoFlow: Learned: order amargeria pizza from brick oven on zomato. I saved 10 steps.

13
00:01:03,086 --> 00:01:06,206
EchoFlow: You can change the item, restaurant. You can see it in the EchoFlow app.

14
00:01:07,393 --> 00:01:09,975
Narration: The saved lesson is the starting point for each replay.

15
00:01:10,504 --> 00:01:11,872
Narration: We do not teach it again.

16
00:01:16,428 --> 00:01:19,389
Request: Order a Margherita pizza, from Brik Oven, on Zomato.

17
00:01:20,605 --> 00:01:22,795
EchoFlow: Okay, order margherita pizza from brik oven on zomato.

18
00:01:23,976 --> 00:01:25,969
Narration: First, we repeat the original request.

19
00:01:26,498 --> 00:01:29,252
Narration: The learned flow works through the restaurant's live interface.

20
00:01:41,879 --> 00:01:47,439
EchoFlow: Your turn. Everything is ready for payment, total ₹285. I won't pay. Please check the order and pay yourself.

21
00:01:55,093 --> 00:01:57,238
Request: Get me a Margherita, from Brik Oven.

22
00:01:58,385 --> 00:02:00,575
EchoFlow: Okay, order margherita pizza from brik oven on zomato.

23
00:02:01,755 --> 00:02:04,364
Narration: Now the words change, while the task stays the same.

24
00:02:04,857 --> 00:02:06,270
Narration: The same lesson is reused.

25
00:02:15,501 --> 00:02:19,278
EchoFlow: Margherita was already in your cart, so I didn't add another one. Your turn.

26
00:02:19,278 --> 00:02:24,061
EchoFlow: Everything is ready for payment, total ₹285. I won't pay. Please check the order and pay yourself.

27
00:02:30,842 --> 00:02:34,355
Request: Order a couple of Farmhouse pizzas, from Brik Oven, on Zomato.

28
00:02:36,348 --> 00:02:38,668
EchoFlow: Okay, order 2 farmhouse pizza from brik oven on zomato.

29
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:41,936
Narration: Next, we change the dish and quantity.

30
00:02:42,456 --> 00:02:45,128
Narration: Two Farmhouse pizzas were not part of the demonstration.

31
00:02:46,133 --> 00:02:48,597
Narration: A new item means finding its current menu entry.

32
00:02:49,127 --> 00:02:51,092
Narration: The replay still has to reach the right cart.

33
00:03:04,968 --> 00:03:09,053
EchoFlow: I added farmhouse with the options that were already selected, ₹260. Your turn.

34
00:03:09,053 --> 00:03:14,178
EchoFlow: Everything is ready for payment, total ₹936. I won't pay. Please check the order and pay yourself.

35
00:03:21,037 --> 00:03:23,953
Request: Order a unicorn pizza, from Brik Oven, on Zomato.

36
00:03:25,170 --> 00:03:27,330
EchoFlow: Okay, order unicorn pizza from brik oven on zomato.

37
00:03:35,748 --> 00:03:39,388
EchoFlow: I searched for "unicorn" at brik oven but couldn't find it. What should I get instead?

38
00:03:41,780 --> 00:03:42,340
Request: Nothing.

39
00:03:44,300 --> 00:03:48,810
EchoFlow: I searched for "unicorn" at brik oven but couldn't find it. So I stopped at step 8 without adding anything.

40
00:03:54,556 --> 00:03:55,923
Request: Did the last run succeed?

41
00:03:57,140 --> 00:04:02,314
EchoFlow: No, the last run didn't succeed. Order unicorn pizza from brik oven on zomato stopped at step 8 of 10 (Tap "ADD").

42
00:04:02,314 --> 00:04:07,130
EchoFlow: I searched for "unicorn" at brik oven but couldn't find it. So I stopped at step 8 without adding anything.

43
00:04:09,286 --> 00:04:09,948
Narration: One lesson.

44
00:04:10,477 --> 00:04:11,202
Narration: New requests.

45
00:04:11,718 --> 00:04:13,621
Narration: A real cart, with payment left to you.
